dsurf, Devin, Claude Code, Antigravity, Profanity, and DNS cache\r\n- Adds multi-profile support for Chrome/Edge + AppImage binary for Linux\r\n- Shrinks the Windows installer by 700KB and installed size by 22MB (47%)\r\n- Many bug fixes & performance improvements across Windows and Linux\r\n\r\n**\ud83d\udcdd [Read full release notes](https://www.bleachbit.org/news/bleachbit-602)** \r\n\r\n## Download\r\n\r\n\u2b07\ufe0f [Download BleachBit 6.0.2 for Windows](https://www.bleachbit.org/download/windows) \r\n\u2b07\ufe0f [Download BleachBit 6.0.2 for Linux](https://www.bleachbit.org/download/linux)\r\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bleachbit/bleachbit/releases/349237740/reactions", "total_count": 33, "+1": 14, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 3, "confused": 0, "heart": 9, "rocket": 2, "eyes": 5}}